{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Written in shalem</b> — like <i>be-shalom</i>." "<b>To Artachshashta</b> — like <i>el</i>." "<b>His companions</b> — his associates or his friends." "<b>And the writing was written</b> — the forms of the letters are called in our language thus [n], and the witness is the Jews according to their script. Or, the writing of this book, <i>nishtavan</i>, is uniform in script and in Aramaic language. And some say: the meaning is a seal [signet], and this is the correct view."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:51.183462182Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}